1
00:00:00,310 --> 00:00:02,535
Procrastination is rarely

2
00:00:02,385 --> 00:00:04,435
a time management problem

3
00:00:04,410 --> 00:00:05,610
It is actually a way

4
00:00:05,435 --> 00:00:07,935
of managing your difficult emotions

5
00:00:08,245 --> 00:00:10,045
Your brain avoids tasks

6
00:00:09,895 --> 00:00:11,595
because they feel boring

7
00:00:11,570 --> 00:00:12,445
difficult

8
00:00:12,370 --> 00:00:13,870
or overwhelming

9
00:00:13,870 --> 00:00:15,070
It tries to protect you

10
00:00:14,920 --> 00:00:16,995
from that discomfort by scrolling

11
00:00:16,870 --> 00:00:18,645
through your phone instead

12
00:00:18,935 --> 00:00:21,110
The 5-minute rule is simple

13
00:00:21,110 --> 00:00:22,085
Commit to working on

14
00:00:21,910 --> 00:00:24,410
a task for exactly 5 minutes

15
00:00:24,310 --> 00:00:25,810
but give yourself real

16
00:00:25,735 --> 00:00:27,635
honest permission to stop once

17
00:00:27,485 --> 00:00:29,485
that timer hits zero

18
00:00:29,830 --> 00:00:31,180
Starting is the hardest

19
00:00:31,030 --> 00:00:32,755
part for our brains

20
00:00:32,730 --> 00:00:34,305
Once you break the seal

21
00:00:34,230 --> 00:00:35,930
momentum kicks in and

22
00:00:35,755 --> 00:00:37,680
your brain naturally wants to finish

23
00:00:37,530 --> 00:00:39,330
what it has already started

24
00:00:39,650 --> 00:00:41,375
Imagine a messy kitchen

25
00:00:41,250 --> 00:00:43,250
or a 10-page report

26
00:00:43,225 --> 00:00:44,225
Thinking about the whole

27
00:00:44,075 --> 00:00:45,850
project is painful

28
00:00:45,775 --> 00:00:48,150
but anyone can wash just five plates

29
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:51,175
or write three sentences in 300 seconds

30
00:00:51,505 --> 00:00:52,780
To make this work

31
00:00:52,705 --> 00:00:54,480
you must set a visible timer

32
00:00:54,430 --> 00:00:57,180
make the first step tiny and specific

33
00:00:57,105 --> 00:00:58,705
and remove friction by putting

34
00:00:58,530 --> 00:01:00,380
your phone in another room

35
00:01:00,715 --> 00:01:02,290
Lowering the barrier to entry

36
00:01:02,140 --> 00:01:04,015
tricks your brain into action

37
00:01:03,890 --> 00:01:05,765
without the fear of failure

38
00:01:05,815 --> 00:01:08,490
Follow for one new idea every day
